  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing the capacity of the European Union through the provision of expertise</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To enhance the capacity of the European Union (EU) in policy analysis and programme management in key areas that are of strategic interest to the UK and in line with DFID priorities.  Examples of such areas include results and evaluation, gender, health &amp; nutrition, conflict prevention and fragile states and the Post-2015 agenda. In addition it will provide support for stronger overall Evaluation and Monitoring of EU spend.</narrative>
  </description>
